flowchart TD
    BACKUP[auto-backup] --> RULES{rules}
    RULES -->|secrets/caches| SKIP[excluded]
    RULES -->|config/data| UP[uploaded]
    RESTORE[restore] --> MIG[migrate schema Ch 36]
    MIG --> SEC{secrets present?}
    SEC -->|no by design| REAUTH[re-authenticate Ch 19]
    SEC -->|n/a| READY[ready]
    IMPORT[import file] --> VAL{valid?}
    VAL -->|no| REJECT[reject]
    VAL -->|yes| MERGE[conflict-aware merge Ch 33]
